{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1413079-suggestion-for-a-one-shot","id":1413079,"title":"Suggestion for a one shot","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-11T12:26:15-07:00","id":1413079,"title":"Suggestion for a one shot","content":"We're going to play Sabbat in Miami, v5 rules and setting.<br /> Tzimisce clan can be a choice. We are going to use what the books suggest.<br /> Chicago Folios have something about tzimisce performing blood sorcery rituals.<br /> Chicago by night clearly says that they most likely have protean.<br /> No house rules for the game, only low umanity rating and discipline replacement for the Fiends.<br /> They guy who want to play the Fiend is planning a ''feral'' tzimisce, inspired by some profiles from the revised clan book and the path of feral hearth.<br /> No fleshcrafting powers required.<br /> <br /> Which discipline set do you suggest :<br /> <br /> <i>Animalism, Blood Sorcery, Protean</i><br /> <br /> or<br /> <br /> <i>Animalism, Auspex, Protean</i><br /> <br /> <br /> Simple as that.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 09-11-2020, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T14:47:19-07:00","id":1413281,"title":"","content":"